# Second coordinate probe: the DESK35 gesture prefix -- open the C: drive icon
# twice, so the item grid of the SECOND (cascaded) window is dumped too. The
# QED.NAP click point in d35.actions comes from this run, not from window 1's
# grid plus a guessed offset.
