1000 arm
1100 mark A_IDLE
1500 move 37 42
1700 down
1703 up
1710 down
1713 up
2300 move 600 240
2900 mark B_WIN1
3200 move 37 42
3400 down
3403 up
3410 down
3413 up
4000 move 600 240
4600 mark C_WIN2
5200 mark D_END
